<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns both secondary credits.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns both secondary credits.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico has completed both credit auctions in the secondary market. The credits were assigned as follows:</p>
<p>    CREDIT AUCTIONS     TERM     AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    1.583  bln pesos    6 days   29.48 pct</p>
<p>    1.000  bln pesos    1 day    29.54 pct</p>
<p>NOTE: The maximum, minimum and average are percentages.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9500</p>
</text>
